ulation of this application does not guarantee the design, size, range of motion, etc. of the actual robot.\nWhen actually installing a robot, please check the specifications on the product page.\n- Please be careful of your surroundings when using this app.", "short_description": "You can place OVR series virtual robots in real space and simulate operation.\nThe OVR series is a robot sold by Oriental Motor."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1594860848028062", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210390_1594860854694728_1273340538204967659_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=udc2qEQf2YcQ7kNvwEOVHmi&_nc_oc=Ado7k0Zbz6hk1d0kQsz9GJGShJttAPifgfgrSegbjZuLySI23mYRJe-nfVTK5Ar3uw4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQUgC-iQLtpSHCzmo3a9-DSzsMmKexAIYGTSnFIbXQzcLQ&oe=6B0F1496"}, {"file_name": "CoverArtLandscapeMini.png", "id": "858590429630683", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974810_858590432964016_3799015126354441121_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HqJUeJDldiMQ7kNvwFfF3Ty&_nc_oc=AdqSKBN9_EbX_Ef0bjkjAlxHe1eBd7mK0JNe4ux15KegdFuEzMTuTPNkqQinpsFVUjs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQUci-kCktmz11_quqT2xhrf_r0B-NjauwOWex1ACMTwsQ&oe=6B0F181C"}, {"file_name": "CoverArtLandscape.png", "id": "495376463065176", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974810_495376466398509_7417159219708782199_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5Z9meEq4YpoQ7kNvwFRDKGi&_nc_oc=AdqS0_2MvST90WyTAoqUs576mcPDshREFabJrOQmXku1x19941S_PP0CtpdstvHNb54&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQWqb6T6fJT3bRvHu7Gs8xbxxANKn3-3OSgZIb_teHq9Ug&oe=6B0EF95B"}, {"file_name": "CoverArtPortrait.png", "id": "486